  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Lifelong Learning, Campus Africa and Knowledge Creation in Maghreb Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention will focus on supporting lifelong learning policies in Maghreb countries and sharing good practices on skills development systems, fostering excellence (in synergy with extra-budgetary TVET and STEM projects) and quality programs. A regional knowledge product will be elaborated in 2024 on effects on teachers of transformation of education, especially digital, highlighting the state of the art, challenges and opportunities and policy alternatives. In Higher Education, the intervention will aim to foster the ratification of Global and Regional Conventions and implement Campus Africa in Maghreb countries, while capitalizing on champion higher education institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
